  13:Src/pose_pipeline.c ****  *
  14:Src/pose_pipeline.c ****  *          Step 3  1-Euro filter  (Casiez et al., CHI 2012)
  15:Src/pose_pipeline.c ****  *                  - adaptive low-pass smoothing, selected over EMA / Kalman
  16:Src/pose_pipeline.c ****  *                    / Butterworth for its good speed-responsiveness trade-off
  17:Src/pose_pipeline.c ****  *
  18:Src/pose_pipeline.c ****  *          Step 4  Feature extraction
  19:Src/pose_pipeline.c ****  *                  - HSSC_X, HSSC_Y  (upper-body centre of mass, kp 0-6)
  20:Src/pose_pipeline.c ****  *                  - VHSSC           (vertical velocity  = dHSSC_Y / dt)
  21:Src/pose_pipeline.c ****  *                  - AHSSC           (vertical accel.   = dVHSSC  / dt)
  22:Src/pose_pipeline.c ****  *
  23:Src/pose_pipeline.c ****  *          Step 5  Circular sliding window (POSE_WINDOW_SIZE frames × 55 feat)
  24:Src/pose_pipeline.c ****  ******************************************************************************
